:"sdrill","tpl":"How much is this {}?","words":["hat","jacket"]}},{"lesson":1,"pos":6,"n":2,"kind":"sdrill","tag":"speak","payload":{"tag":"speak","pic":"hat","k":"sdrill","tpl":"This is {} thousand won.","words":["ten","twenty","thirty","fifty"]}},{"lesson":1,"pos":6,"n":3,"kind":"sdrill","tag":"speak","payload":{"tag":"speak","pic":"socks","k":"sdrill","tpl":"They're {} thousand won.","words":["two","thirteen","fifteen","forty"]}},{"lesson":1,"pos":7,"n":0,"kind":"scene","tag":"listen","payload":{"tag":"listen","pic":"sunglasses","k":"scene","title":"학교 소풍 준비 쇼핑 ①","scenes":[{"who":"Jun","en":"Let's buy things for our school trip tomorrow!","ko":"내일 학교 소풍에 쓸 물건을 사자!"},{"who":"Jun","en":"I love shopping!","ko":"나는 쇼핑이 정말 좋아!"},{"who":"Mom","en":"Jun, we can buy things on this list.","ko":"준아, 이 목록에 있는 것만 살 수 있어."},{"who":"Clerk","en":"May I help you?","ko":"도와드릴까요?"},{"who":"Mom","en":"Yes, please.","ko":"네, 부탁해요."},{"who":"Jun","en":"I'm looking for some sunglasses.","ko":"저는 선글라스를 찾고 있어요."},{"who":"Clerk","en":"We have many cool sunglasses here.","ko":"여기에 멋진 선글라스가 많이 있어요."},{"who":"Clerk","en":"How about these sunglasses?","ko":"이 선글라스는 어때요?"},{"who":"Jun","en":"They're nice. I like the color.","ko":"멋지네요. 색깔이 마음에 들어요."},{"who":"Jun","en":"How much are these sunglasses?","ko":"이 선글라스는 얼마예요?"},{"who":"Clerk","en":"They're 13,000 won.","ko":"13,000원이에요."},{"who":"Mom","en":"Good.","ko":"좋아."},{"who":"Jun","en":"I'll take them.","ko":"이걸로 살게요."}],"sub":"en","explain":["[[May I help you?]]는 가게에서 점원이 \"도와드릴까요?\"라고 말을 거는 표현이에요.","여러 개(sunglasses)의 가격은 [[How much are these …?]]로 묻고, [[They're … won.]]으로 대답해요.","사겠다고 말할 때는 [[I'll take them.]]이라고 해요."],"review":true,"replay":2,"qs":[{"t":"mc","q":"준이 사려고 한 물건은 무엇인가요?","ans":"선글라스","wrong":["반바지","모자"]},{"t":"mc","q":"선글라스의 가격은 얼마인가요?","ans":"13,000원","wrong":["15,000원","3,000원"]}]}},{"lesson":1,"pos":8,"n":0,"kind":"scene","tag":"listen","payload":{"tag":"listen","pic":"shoes","k":"scene","title":"학교 소풍 준비 쇼핑 ②","scenes"